		{"id":"bb8173852f48451b","type":"text","text":"### 左岸伏尔泰河岸旧书摊，街景参考\n摄影：Cheng-en Cheng from Taichung City, Taiwan  ·  [CC BY-SA 2.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0)\n[原始照片与来源](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bouquiniste_Quai_Voltaire_(49630870472).jpg)","x":950,"y":2795,"width":430,"height":185},
		{"id":"6e22d7b668c14147","type":"text","text":"### 莎士比亚书店外立面\n摄影：celebrategreatness  ·  [CC BY 2.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0)\n[原始照片与来源](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:01_Shakespeare_and_Company.jpg)","x":10,"y":2795,"width":430,"height":185},
		{"id":"de8070fcc901407f","type":"file","file":"场景候选/巴黎地铁站台_无人场景候选_20261027.png","x":1600,"y":1550,"width":720,"height":405},
		{"id":"bbb6d7431aab4769","type":"text","text":"## 巴黎地铁｜站台候选\n\n第一集明确空间：女主在巴黎地铁看到 Lucas 并听见同一首曲子。站台构图留白；钢琴/音乐来源的具体位置尚未设定，未擅自画出演奏者或钢琴。\n\n状态：候选。\nSHA-256：`60cc5e7ae792ae35e7cc4d76185e7a5fb829cdb033b48af097d9ea4cc7dc24a8`","x":1600,"y":1975,"width":720,"height":300,"color":"4"},
