		{"id":"3f89849de9d54db5","type":"text","text":"### 巴黎阁楼小公寓｜蒙马特 15㎡\n\n屋顶小空间、木质面板、入口与厨房的实景案例。\n\n[打开原始照片页面](https://www.architecturaldigest.com/story/this-161-square-foot-attic-in-paris-boasts-mahogany-panels-and-versatile-furniture-on-a-budget)","x":950,"y":4985,"width":430,"height":240},
		{"id":"4c42d9f17f344bea","type":"text","text":"### 巴黎屋顶租屋｜19㎡\n\n巴黎旧式小房间改造实景与屋顶景观。\n\n[打开原始照片页面](https://www.marieclaire.fr/chambre-de-bonne-19m2-studio-paris-astuces-gain-de-place%2C1460684.asp)","x":1420,"y":4985,"width":430,"height":240},
