		{"id":"5961b68e20284ed1","type":"text","text":"### Studio Beaubourg｜巴黎三区 18㎡\n\n屋顶斜面、床、厨房和真实室内照片；建筑师 Bea Bühler 摄影。\n\n[打开原始照片页面](https://www.beabuehler.com/projets/studio-beaubourg)","x":10,"y":4985,"width":430,"height":240},
