		{"id":"65fa7bd9c32f49c2","type":"text","text":"### Studio ANY｜巴黎十六区 13㎡\n\n天窗、阁楼床和紧凑租屋布局；页面含多张实景照片与平面图。\n\n[打开原始照片页面](https://www.nevertoosmall.com/post/a-chambre-de-bonne-with-a-skylight-loft)","x":480,"y":4985,"width":430,"height":240},
